# The number of sub-trades, their counterparties and percentages come from the case's subTrades; equal or unequal
# only names the split.
@When "^perform (?:equal|unequal) allocation for the trade$"
    When opens lifecycle action 'allocation' for current trade
    And the number of sub-trades of the case is stored as 'subTradeCount'
    And component allocation dialog enters split number from stored variable 'subTradeCount'
    And user fills the sub-trade rows of the case
    And component allocation dialog total pct value is 'Total: 100.00% ✓'
    And submits allocation event and waits for allocation response

@When "^submits allocation event and waits for allocation response$"
    When confirm allocation form using configured risk engine mode for trade stored as 'createdTradeId'
    And component trade change confirmation dialog is visible
    And component trade change confirmation types comments from stored variable 'comments'
    And page trade portal confirms trade change, captures response as 'allocationResponse' and waits for New Today Blotter to reload
    And store e2e response list 'data.results[0].childTradeIds' from stored variable 'allocationResponse' as numbered 'allocatedTradeId'

@Then "^the allocation is completed successfully$"
    Then assert toast notification with type 'success' and message from stored variable 'toastMessage'

@Then "^the trade is allocated to Dead in the trade details$"
    When navigate to trade details for stored trade 'createdTradeId'
    Then page trade detail status badge shows 'DEAD'
